[gd_scene format=3]

; Moves one variable: a tile's own TileData modulate, which Godot multiplies onto the tile's
; pixels. Two red tiles sit side by side, the right one drawn from alternative 1, tinted and half
; transparent. No other tile scene authors a TileData modulate.

